, CEO & Director | Age 56 | Compensation: $8.7M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 1K people. Each employee generates $381K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $163K per employee reflects an ownership culture. Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (10/10).","financial_summary":["Moelis & Company is a mid-cap financial services business with a $4.1B market cap.","Returns on capital run at 169% against a 11% cost of capital \u2014 a 158-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $540M in free cash flow, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 2.47\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Shareholder yield of 4.6% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 7.6% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Payout ratio of 89% leaves thin coverage if earnings wobble","sev":"amber","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Reinvestment rate supports 19% organic growth capacity \u2014 capital is compounding inside the business","Trading at a 32% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","11 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Financial Services peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Runway Growth Finance (NASDAQ:RWAY) vs. Moelis & Company (NYSE:MC) Financial Contrast","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/runway-growth-finance-nasdaqrway-vs-moelis-company-nysemc-financial-contrast.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794582910.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.943,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Does Earnings Beat Change The Bull Case For Moelis Stock (MC)?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/diversified-financials/nyse-mc/moelis/news/does-earnings-beat-change-the-bull-case-for-moelis-stock-mc","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794486384.18,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.727,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Four Days Left To Buy Moelis & Company (NYSE:MC) Before The Ex-Dividend Date","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/diversified-financials/nyse-mc/moelis/news/fou